WEBVTT

00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:30.265
Kung ang banal na henyo na nakatalaga sayo

00:18:30.265 --> 00:18:35.349
ay nagpasya na hayaang ipasulyap ang nakakamangha, kahit sandali lang

00:18:35.349 --> 00:18:37.349
dahil sa pagsisikap mo, kung gayon man, "Ole!"

00:18:37.349 --> 00:18:40.988
Kung hindi man, sumayaw ka pa rin.

00:18:40.988 --> 00:18:42.669
At "Ole!" pa rin sayo, gayunpaman.

00:18:42.669 --> 00:18:44.669
Naniniwala ako dito at nararamdaman ko dapat natin ito ituro.

00:18:44.669 --> 00:18:46.457
"Ole!" sayo, kahit ano pa man,

00:18:46.457 --> 00:18:49.770
kahit man lang sa pagkakaron ng lubos na pag-ibig at kasutilan

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:51.615
sa patuloy na pagpapakita.

00:18:51.615 --> 00:18:53.290
Maraming salamat.

00:18:53.290 --> 00:18:55.365
(Palakpak)

00:18:55.365 --> 00:18:56.856
Maraming salamat.

00:18:56.856 --> 00:18:59.970
(Palakpak)

00:18:59.970 --> 00:19:01.803
June Cohen: Ole!